	abstract = {{\textless}h3{\textgreater}Introduction{\textless}/h3{\textgreater}
{\textless}p{\textgreater}L2-KSU Native and Non-Native Arabic Speech was developed by {\textless}a href="http://ksu.edu.sa/en/"{\textgreater}King Saud University{\textless}/a{\textgreater}\&nbsp;(KSU) and contains approximately six hours of Modern Standard Arabic read speech from 80 subjects, along with transcripts and speaker metadata.{\textless}/p{\textgreater}
{\textless}h3{\textgreater}Data{\textless}/h3{\textgreater}
